{"unit_id":"tag:0GQ4:statement","translation":"在引理 <REF_0001> 的情形下，我们有复形（complexes）的映射（maps）\n<MATH_0001>。这些映射（maps）接近于构成一个特 distinguished triangle，应为区别三角（distinguished triangle），见《模（Modules）》引理 <REF_0002>。如果它是一个区别三角（distinguished triangle），我们就可得出：<MATH_0002> 在 <MATH_0003> 中的像（image）将是（<REF_0003>）存在解的障碍（obstruction）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"余切复形。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"复形间的箭头。"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角","context":"复形的三角。"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"Ext 元素的像。"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍","context":"解存在的障碍。"}],"notes":["remark：原文 closed to forming 疑为拼写问题，按接近构成的语义译出；保护公式中的下标原样保留。"]}
