{"unit_id":"tag:0D13:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节明确说明第 <REF_0001> 节的结果对概形（schemes）的形变（deformations）意味着什么。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"deformations","target_term":"形变"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"形变的对象。"},{"source_term":"deformations","target_term":"形变","context":"前节结果的应用。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D14:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（schemes）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。设 <MATH_0002> 是概形（schemes）的平坦（flat）态射（morphism）。如果存在概形（schemes）的平坦（flat）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003> 以及在 <MATH_0005> 上的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0004>，则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对（pairs）<MATH_0006> 的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在\n<MATH_0007>\n的作用下是主齐性的（principal homogeneous），并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 自同构（automorphisms）<MATH_0008> 的集合（set），其中这些自同构在 <MATH_0009> 上且在 <MATH_0010> 上约化为恒等映射（identity），就是 <MATH_0011>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的"},{"source_term":"automorphisms","target_term":"自同构"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"加厚及态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"平方零加厚。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"概形间态射。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"约化后的同构。"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"对","context":"态射与同构组成的对。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"提升的同构类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"同构类及自同构的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的","context":"Ext 群作用。"},{"source_term":"automorphisms","target_term":"自同构","context":"提升的自同构。"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射","context":"约化后的映射。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D14:proof","translation":"首先注意，《态射进阶（More on Morphisms）》第 <REF_0001> 节所定义的概形（schemes）的加厚（thickenings），就是概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms），且它们是第 <REF_0002> 节意义下的加厚（thickenings）。可将 <MATH_0001> 视为 <MATH_0002> 的闭子概形（closed subscheme），使 <MATH_0003> 成为一阶加厚（first order thickenings）的态射（morphism）。于是由《态射进阶（More on Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0003>（或更一般的引理 <REF_0004>）可知，<MATH_0004> 在 <MATH_0005> 中的理想（ideal）层（sheaf）等于 <MATH_0006>。因此我们有交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0007>，其中竖直箭头是 <MATH_0008>-映射（maps）；请与（<REF_0005>）比较。因此，(1) 由引理 <REF_0006> 推出，(2) 由引理 <REF_0007> 的 (2) 推出。（注意，<MATH_0009> 在概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）的情形下按《态射进阶（More on Morphisms）》第 <REF_0008> 节定义，它与第 <REF_0009> 节使用的 <MATH_0010> 一致。）\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"More on Morphisms","target_term":"态射进阶"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"More on Morphisms","target_term":"态射进阶"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"More on Morphisms","target_term":"态射进阶"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"More on Morphisms","target_term":"态射进阶","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚","context":"两处定义的比较。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"概形态射。"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形","context":"X 在 X' 中。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"加厚态射。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"加厚间态射。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"定义闭子概形的理想。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"理想层。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"结构层的交换图。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"竖直箭头。"}],"notes":[]}
